Index: openwiki/.claims/guides/adding-a-command.json
===================================================================
--- openwiki/.claims/guides/adding-a-command.json	
+++ openwiki/.claims/guides/adding-a-command.json	
@@ -0,0 +1,108 @@
+{
+  "schemaVersion": 1,
+  "pageVersion": "sha256:031d3247dfa450ce3326c431ae6b4c08fa074443d7977d23882708cc6894ee99",
+  "claims": [
+    {
+      "id": "claim_048641179ae24a6c9574440b3f8bf86a",
+      "statement": "Command packages follow the urfave/cli layout: each command/subcommand hierarchy level lives in its own package under command/, and non-command-specific logic belongs in shared packages like flags or cli-utils.",
+      "evidence": [
+        {
+          "resource": "repo://command/README.md#L5-L17",
+          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9fe048319b92f0f4c890b4490a05af4eccb5012e56b2a584ba03188e4343944d:"
+        }
+      ]
+    },
+    {
+      "id": "claim_069ad78342674425a3cbf5a84bea1cc4",
+      "statement": "New top-level commands register a cli.Command via command.Register in package init() and are enabled by blank imports in internal/cmd/root.go.",
+      "evidence": [
+        {
+          "resource": "repo://command/version/version.go#L14-L27",
+          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2cb5d77381d423b3da1b75ea3707e0942113c7b108c7c1e9a85965a49a15c4df:"
+        },
+        {
+          "resource": "repo://internal/cmd/root.go#L30-L44",
+          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f9fa64bb672657064979bc070b7384bed68f5506a51a855e664a942f483aa20e:"
+        }
+      ]
+    },
+    {
+      "id": "claim_be8f9feb667945e7b95cd02ad903ef4c",
+      "statement": "Subcommand flags are defined on the cli.Command and the action reads them from the urfave/cli context, as shown by the base64 command.",
+      "evidence": [
+        {
+          "resource": "repo://command/base64/base64.go#L18-L83",
+          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:18cf0c3f492804af6cd7279480cbaa715911901104abfceb397b82e3822b80ea:"
+        }
+      ]
+    },
+    {
+      "id": "claim_00beca5506914377a7d32c0a7b1bac6e",
+      "statement": "Group subcommands are wired into the parent command's Subcommands list by calling their command-constructor functions.",
+      "evidence": [
+        {
+          "resource": "repo://command/ca/ca.go#L68-L85",
+          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:8230a6d6d09ba737c95661e68d3241c2f6da71f6cbebb101c45d273998dad1b3:"
+        }
+      ]
+    },
+    {
+      "id": "claim_3acc494698cb46e8a5e83cd775b54100",
+      "statement": "The documented conventions are to reuse existing flags from the flags package, use cli-utils/errs for error construction so errors become urfave/cli.ExitError, and keep command-specific errors in the command package.",
+      "evidence": [
+        {
+          "resource": "repo://command/README.md#L83-L91",
+          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9b31e900c9f74f5e6e6de1a4e9361af358882544c1e4baffd326449c82fd5fa0:"
+        }
+      ]
+    },
